subsection.def:
national emblem (國徽) has the meaning given by section 2(1) of the National
                Flag and National Emblem Ordinance (116 of 1997);
                    (Added 30 of 2023 s. 5)

national flag (國旗) has the meaning given by section 2(1) of the National
                Flag and National Emblem Ordinance (116 of 1997);
                    (Added 30 of 2023 s. 5)
